/-!
# The supplied A₆ section's conjugation action

The marked involution centralizer and source alpha relations prove that
A<mu-prime> acts faithfully on the supplied A₆. This module exports the
actual action and its proof, together with the full centralizer kernel as
an ambient subgroup. Identification of the symmetric image and of the
centralizing four-group are the remaining assembly obligations.

Source: D. Held, Illinois J. Math. 13 (1969), 224–240,
DOI 10.1215/ijm/1256053756, Lemma 4.2, pp.234–235.
-/
